/-! # Einstein–Maxwell residual for the 5D EF static family (ATLAS-VI-01)

Generated by `scratch/vi01_gen/gen_em.py`. For all `mu beta Q : ℝ` and `x ∈ domU5`
(`r = x 1`, `u = x 2`, `f = 1 - μ/r² + β/r⁴`):

* `faraday5 Q = d (emPot5 Q)` on `domU5`, hence `H_{abc} = 0` (`faradayCyclic`);
* `F^{01} = Q/r³`, `F^{10} = -Q/r³` (all other `F^{ab} = 0`), `F_{ab}F^{ab} = -2Q²/r⁶`;
* `J^b = 0` (`maxwellDiv`) for every `mu beta Q`;
* `E_{ab} = (3β - Q²) · B_{ab}` with `B` = `emFactorEF5` (25 components).

All Ricci input comes from the proved lemmas `ricci_ab` (`Ricci.lean`, `RicciOffDiag.lean`)
and `ricciScalar_ef5`; no field-equation hypothesis is assumed. -/

open scoped ContDiff
